 time you&apos;re missing is hiding in procrastination</title><link>https://www.novifyx.com/tips/procrastination/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.novifyx.com/tips/procrastination/</guid><description>The time you&apos;re missing is hiding in procrastination</description><pubDate>Fri, 26 Jan 2024 16:21:19 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>CAP theorem</title><link>https://www.novifyx.com/posts/system-design-cap-theorem/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.novifyx.com/posts/system-design-cap-theorem/</guid><description>How Brewer&apos;s theorem plays role in designing a distributed system</description><pubDate>Tue, 23 Jan 2024 16:24:20 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Building brand around your name</title><link>https://www.novifyx.com/posts/em101-building-brand/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.novifyx.com/posts/em101-building-brand/</guid><description>Whether you are a talented engineer or manager or &quot;insert your role&quot;, you should make an additional effort to give your name recognition.</description><pubDate>Sat, 20 Jan 2024 23:50:36 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Make your blog, it will be fun!</title><link>https://www.novifyx.com/posts/this-blog/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.novifyx.com/posts/this-blog/</guid><description>My path of overcoming hurdles and challenges around bringing this blog to live</description><pubDate>Fri, 19 Jan 2024 18:29:14 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>